<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Notice of Termination"
    recipientType="Contact"
    relatedToType="ServiceRequest__c">

<messaging:htmlEmailBody >

<html>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">

<!-- Header Image -->
<div style="text-align: center;">
    <img src="http://cdn.mcauto-images-production.sendgrid.net/e8b0a57e5c62d448/faec48e3-ed7c-4bd7-8c65-56e42990cc99/3000x481.jpg"
         style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;"/>
</div>

<!-- Title Section -->
<div style="background-color: #f2f2f2; padding: 15px; text-align: left;">
    <div style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;">
        Notice of Termination
    </div>
    <div style="font-size: 14px;">
        Service Request Number: {!relatedTo.Name}
    </div>
</div>

<table style="text-align:justify;width:100%;">

<tr>
<td colspan="2">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td colspan="2">
    Dear {!relatedTo.AccountId__r.Name},
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td colspan="2">&nbsp;</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td colspan="2">

We refer to our previous communications, including <b>Default Notice (Notice 1)</b> and 
<b>Default Notice (Notice 2)</b>, regarding the outstanding payment related to your property with Modon.
<br/><br/>

As a result of this termination, Modon reserves all rights and remedies available to it under the 
Sale and Purchase Agreement and applicable laws, including but not limited to the treatment of 
amounts paid to date, recovery of outstanding sums, and any other contractual or statutory entitlements.
<br/><br/>

This notice is issued without prejudice to any rights, remedies, claims, or actions available to 
Modon under the Agreement or applicable laws.
<br/><br/>

Should you require clarification regarding this notice, you may contact us on 
<b>800 MODON (800 66366)</b> or email 
<a href="mailto:customercare@modon.com">customercare@modon.com</a>. 
Any communication received will be addressed strictly without prejudice to Modon’s rights.

</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td colspan="2">
<br/>Best Regards,<br/><br/>
<b>Modon</b>
</td>
</tr>

</table>

<!-- Footer -->
<div style="text-align: left; background-color: #f2f2f2; padding: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: #000000; margin-top: 30px;">
<b>modon.com</b>
</div>

</body>
</html>

</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>